{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20023","headline":"投赠张端公 · 孟郊","name":"投赠张端公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子量不极，胸吞百川流。\n嫉邪霜气直，问俗春辞柔。\n日户昼辉静，月杯夜景幽。\n咏惊芙蓉发，笑激风飙秋。\n鸾步独无侣，鹤音仍寡俦。\n幸沾分寸顾，散此千万忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}